{"840890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rocket Rush", "steam_appid": 840890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where nothing you do seems to work. And all paths lead to anger. Rocket Rush will... make it worse. In this minimalist hard platformer you will attempt to traverse a seemingly endless world filled with traps, fire and a bunch of other doo-dads designed and positioned specifically to upset you. Sounds fun, right? For the low low price listed you too can join the others who made a questionable decision and eventually wound up hating themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/192e7c566e001d7b7d48db97b477d4e9.poster.avif?t=1732489532\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/192e7c566e001d7b7d48db97b477d4e9.webm?t=1732489532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/192e7c566e001d7b7d48db97b477d4e9.mp4?t=1732489532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Land on the green pad... Not that hard right?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What a simple basic concept for a game. Surely it cant be that hard right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/fec052511323e658ef5188ac23232cc1.poster.avif?t=1732489532\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/fec052511323e658ef5188ac23232cc1.webm?t=1732489532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/fec052511323e658ef5188ac23232cc1.mp4?t=1732489532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Carpal tunnel simulator&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We take no responsibility for any conditions aggravated or cause by the required key mashing to speed run the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/561c30ccb5518013dfe14d10469cbb97.poster.avif?t=1732489532\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/561c30ccb5518013dfe14d10469cbb97.webm?t=1732489532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/561c30ccb5518013dfe14d10469cbb97.mp4?t=1732489532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some traps are obvious... But some are not...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because if you can see them all how can we make you mad? Think silly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/1c957c2983af964b4ad0d56b52d53775.poster.avif?t=1732489532\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/1c957c2983af964b4ad0d56b52d53775.webm?t=1732489532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/840890/extras/1c957c2983af964b4ad0d56b52d53775.mp4?t=1732489532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where nothing you do seems to work. And all paths lead to anger. Rocket Rush will..